{"id": "de-witze-1s5wyg5.ru", "jokeId": "de-witze-1s5wyg5", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "reworked", "notes": "Brands rebuilt for Russia: 2ГИС (twins), «Три медведя» (triplets), «Четыре лапы» (quadruplets), «Седьмой континент» (punchline, seven). Lines otherwise follow the original; the fourth father is the barman as a supermarket salesman.", "title": "Четыре отца", "location": "bolnitsa", "cast": ["devushka", "muzhik", "muzhik-sosed", "muzhik-ryzhy", "barmen"], "roles": {"devushka": "nurse", "muzhik": "father", "muzhik-sosed": "father", "muzhik-ryzhy": "father", "barmen": "salesman"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Четверо мужчин сидят в приёмном покое роддома, пока их жёны рожают.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "devushka", "text": "Поздравляю, вы стали отцом двойни!", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": ["devushka"]}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Всё сходится. Я работаю в «Два ГИС»!", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "devushka", "text": "Поздравляю, у вас тройня!", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Какое совпадение. Я работаю на пивзаводе «Три медведя»!", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "devushka", "text": "С ума сойти, у вас четверня!", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik-ryzhy", "text": "Не может быть. Я работаю в «Четырёх лапах»!", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Четвёртый вдруг белеет как мел, хватается за голову и начинает дрожать.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Что это с вами?", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Я работаю в «Седьмом континенте»!", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "de-witze-1s5wyg5.en", "jokeId": "de-witze-1s5wyg5", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "reworked", "notes": "Brands swapped per note: Minnesota Twins, 3M, Four Seasons, 7-Eleven (spelled out for TTS). Lines otherwise follow the original; the fourth father is the barman in his store-clerk uniform.", "title": "Four Fathers", "location": "bolnitsa", "cast": ["devushka", "muzhik", "muzhik-sosed", "muzhik-ryzhy", "barmen"], "roles": {"devushka": "nurse", "muzhik": "father", "muzhik-sosed": "father", "muzhik-ryzhy": "father", "barmen": "salesman"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Four men are sitting in the hospital waiting room while their wives give birth.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "devushka", "text": "Congratulations, you're the father of twins!", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": ["devushka"]}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "That figures. I work for the Minnesota Twins!", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "devushka", "text": "Congratulations, it's triplets!", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "What a coincidence. I work at Three M!", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "devushka", "text": "Amazing, it's quadruplets!", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik-ryzhy", "text": "No way. I work at the Four Seasons!", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "The fourth man suddenly turns white as chalk, grabs his head and starts to tremble.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "What's the matter with you?", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "I work at Seven-Eleven!", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
